# Ratchet baseline for scripts/forbid_naive_router_location.sh.
#
# Every file below reads `currentConfiguration.uri`/`.fullPath` directly. As
# audited on introduction (2026-07-19), none of them push a route ON TOP OF
# the location they then read (they only exercise `.go`/redirects at the read
# site), so the ImperativeRouteMatch exclusion this gate guards against does
# not bite them — they are correct as written, just not routed through the
# shared `AppHarness.location`/`AppHarness.expectLocation` helper.
#
# The two files this gate exists BECAUSE OF —
# integration_test/master_bookings_flow_test.dart and
# integration_test/logout_flow_test.dart — are deliberately NOT in this list;
# they were the actual bug and are now fixed.
#
# This baseline only ever shrinks: when a listed file is next meaningfully
# touched and it starts pushing on top of a location it reads, migrate it to
# the shared helper and drop it from here. New files are gated from line one.
